---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../normalize.css";
import "../shared.css";
import "../privacy-policy/privacy-policy.css";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - Iron Wing Dispatching">
<main>
            <section class="privacy-policy">
                <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p>
                    <strong>Effective Date:</strong>
                    2/18/2025
                    <br />
                    <strong>Last Updated:</strong>
                    11/4/2026
                </p>
                <p>
                    Welcome to
                    <strong>Iron Wing Dispatching</strong>
                    ("Company," "we," "us," or "our"). Your privacy is important
                    to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and
                    protect your personal information when you visit our website
                    <strong>iron-wing-dispatching.com</strong>
                    and use our services.
                </p>

                <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
                <h3>A. Information You Provide to Us:</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Contact Information:</strong>
                        Name, email address, phone number, and company details.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Payment Information:</strong>
                        Billing details (processed securely through third-party
                        providers).
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h3>B. Information Collected Automatically:</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Website Usage Data:</strong>
                        IP addresses, browser type, device information, pages
                        visited.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Communication Data:</strong>
                        Any messages sent through contact forms or live chat.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Provide and manage dispatching services.</li>
                    <li>Respond to inquiries and customer support requests.</li>
                    <li>Improve our website and services.</li>
                    <li>
                        Send important updates or marketing communications (with
                        your consent).
                    </li>
                    <li>Comply with legal obligations.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>3. Sharing Your Information</h2>
                <p>
                    We do
                    <strong>not</strong>
                    sell or rent your personal data. However, we may share your
                    information with:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Service Providers:</strong>
                        Third-party companies that help with website hosting,
                        payment processing, text-message delivery, or marketing.
                        Mobile phone numbers and text-messaging consent are
                        never shared for third-party marketing.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Legal Authorities:</strong>
                        If required by law or to protect our rights.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h2 id="sms-privacy">SMS / Text Messaging</h2>
                <p>
                    If you give us your mobile phone number and agree to receive
                    text messages, we use it to send operational messages about
                    our dispatching services, such as load offers, rate
                    confirmations, dispatch instructions, and account updates.
                    See our
                    <a href="/terms.html#sms-terms">Terms and Conditions</a>
                    for the full program terms.
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Consent:</strong>
                        We collect consent to text you verbally, during a phone
                        call with our representative. We record your phone
                        number, the date and time of consent, and who obtained
                        it. Consent is not a condition of using our services.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>No sharing for marketing:</strong>
                        We do not sell, rent, or share your mobile phone number
                        or your text-messaging consent with third parties or
                        affiliates for their marketing or promotional purposes.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Service providers:</strong>
                        We use messaging providers, such as Twilio, only to
                        deliver and manage our messages for us. They may process
                        your phone number and message content for that purpose
                        only.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Opt out:</strong>
                        Reply STOP at any time to stop receiving texts, or HELP
                        for help. Message and data rates may apply, and message
                        frequency varies.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h2>4. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
                <p>
                    We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience. You can
                    manage your cookie preferences in your browser settings.
                </p>

                <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
                <p>
                    We implement security measures to protect your information.
                    However, no online transmission is 100% secure.
                </p>

                <h2>6. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Request access, correction, or deletion of your personal
                        data.
                    </li>
                    <li>Opt out of marketing emails at any time.</li>
                    <li>Disable cookies through browser settings.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2>
                <p>
                    Our website may contain links to external websites. We are
                    not responsible for their privacy policies or content.
                </p>

                <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
                <p>
                    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any
                    changes will be posted on this page with the updated date.
                </p>

                <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
                <p>If you have any questions, contact us at:</p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Email:</strong>
                    info@iron-wing-dispatching.com
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Address:</strong>
                    30 N Gould St, Sheridan, WY 82801
                </p>
            </section>
        </main>
</BaseLayout>
